  "content": "<h2>特色</h2><h3>新增物品</h3><p><strong>獄髓裝飾鞘翅</strong></p><ul>\n<li>不會在熔岩或火焰中燃燒</li>\n<li>提供 +4 盔甲值</li>\n<li>雙倍耐久度（864）</li>\n</ul><h3>新增合成配方</h3><p><strong>獄髓裝飾鞘翅鍛造配方</strong></p><ul>\n<li>獄髓升級鍛造模板</li>\n<li>鞘翅</li>\n<li>獄髓錠</li>\n</ul><h3>新增進度</h3><p><strong>重金屬之翼</strong></p><ul>\n<li>獲得獄髓裝飾鞘翅</li>\n</ul><h2>相容性</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-trims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Trims</a> 作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKikuGie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">KikuGie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felytra-physics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Physics</a> 作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fOhHeyItsJosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OhHeyItsJosh</a></li>\n</ul><h2>常見問題</h2><blockquote>\n  <p><strong>問：你會支援其他 Minecraft 版本和模組載入器嗎？</strong></p>\n  <p>答：如果我的 Discord 上有足夠的需求，我會將模組移植到其他版本和模組載入器。</p>\n</blockquote><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fpw8BsjsXfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>",
